Control the fastest guns in space in Aces of the Galaxy, the non-stop, old-school arcade space-shooter for the 21st century. Utilize an impressive arsenal of upgradeable weapons including powerful missile launchers, devastating torpedoes and the ever-reliant chain gun to annihilate the rival Skurgian Empire ships.
- Temporal Shift: Intense feature slows down the hordes of enemies
- Stunning Visuals: Bring the action up close and personal
- 3rd Person Action: Retro-arcade shooter gameplay style